{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 2 cents per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. DAO governance on Snapshot per space: the proposals ChainHelix tracks for the space (its most recent ones) recorded inside the window, each counted once at its latest recorded state, split by state (active, pending, closed), with the latest vote count and score total of those proposals, most voted first. space is a Snapshot space id such as aavedao.eth. window in hours, default 168, max 1440. A proposal is recorded when its state, votes or score change and at least every 6 hours",
